# Example environment for the Recipes AI Search (WILS-4).
# Copy to `.env` and fill in real values. Never commit real keys.

# ── Search service (Cloudflare Worker in front of hosted Meilisearch) ──
# Search endpoints are served by search/worker (wrangler deploy), NOT by
# Meilisearch directly — the Worker holds the Meilisearch key server-side so it
# never ships to the browser. Literal secrets below exist only on the Worker
# (`wrangler secret put`), not in this file.
#
# Required secrets on the Worker:
#   MEILI_URL          https://<your-instance>.meilisearch.com  (or self-hosted URL)
#   MEILI_SEARCH_KEY   Meilisearch search-only key (actions: ["search"],
#                      indexes: ["recipes"]) — never the master key
#
# Public Worker vars (safe to commit): see search/worker/wrangler.toml
#   MEILI_INDEX        recipes
#   ALLOWED_ORIGINS    site origin + localhost dev origins
#   EMBEDDER           "default" (hybrid) or "off" (keyword-only)

# ── Indexing (run on your machine, not on the site) ──────────────────
# MEILI_URL=http://localhost:7700
# MEILI_MASTER_KEY=<set at docker compose up; keep private>
# MEILI_INDEX=recipes
# To enable embeddings on a fresh index, configure the embedder on the
# Meilisearch instance once (see docs/search-deployment.md §Embeddings);
# the indexer then reindexes with vectors. If embeddings are unavailable the
# Worker degrades every query to keyword-only automatically.

# ── Site build (read by src/search.js via Vite; build-time only) ──────
# Leave empty to keep the static local-substring search.
# VITE_SEARCH_ENDPOINT=https://recipes-search.<subdomain>.workers.dev
# VITE_SEARCH_HYBRID=true

# ── Optional: Claude/other LLM key if a generative feature reuses it ──
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=<never commit>